      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Order \nThis is first application filed by the applicants under Section 483 of BNSS, 2023 (Section 439 of the Cr.P.C., 1973) for grant of regular bail relating to FIR No.86/2024, dated 14.07.2024 registered at Police Station- Alipura, District- Chhatarpur (M.P.) for commission of offence punishable under Sections 498- A,304-B, 34,376,376(2)(s),376(d),302,201 of IPC and Section 3/4 of Dowry Prohibition Act.",
