      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2760590612888336
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2 . As per the prosecution story,\nmarriage of deceased Laxmi Anuragi was performed with Hari Shankar Anuragi sometime in the year 2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1023,
      "end": 1158,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Laxmi Anuragi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1078,
          "end": 1091
        },
        {
          "text": "Hari Shankar Anuragi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1111,
          "end": 1131
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.200077086687088
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "On 27.04.2024 in-law's of Laxmi informed her father that she is missing from the home since 9.00 A.M.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1159,
      "end": 1260,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27.04.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1162,
          "end": 1172
        },
        {
          "text": "Laxmi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1185,
          "end": 1190
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2690780460834503
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Brother of Laxmi Anuragi came to village Kemaha and informed his father that Laxmi is not available there.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1261,
      "end": 1367,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Laxmi Anuragi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1272,
          "end": 1285
        },
        {
          "text": "Kemaha",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1302,
          "end": 1308
        },
        {
          "text": "Laxmi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1338,
          "end": 1343
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2521415948867798
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Thereafter, he alongwith father-in-law of Laxmi lodged the missing report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1368,
      "end": 1442,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Laxmi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1410,
          "end": 1415
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27525606751441956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "On 01.05.2024 dead body of Laxmi was recovered from Pahadibanda Dam.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1443,
      "end": 1511,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01.05.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1446,
          "end": 1456
        },
        {
          "text": "Laxmi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1470,
          "end": 1475
        },
        {
          "text": "Pahadibanda Dam",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1495,
          "end": 1510
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2762330174446106
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "After postmortem Viscera was sent for FSL examination and bone was also sent for diatom test.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1512,
      "end": 1605,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSL",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1553
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22979618608951569
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "In Viscera report, aluminum phosphate NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-JBP:1194 2 MCRC-55806-2024 was found.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1606,
      "end": 1712,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "aluminum phosphate NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1625,
          "end": 1669
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13973233103752136
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "In FSL report human sperms were found in the vaginal slide of the deceased.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1713,
      "end": 1788,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "FSL",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1716,
          "end": 1719
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2301257997751236
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "In the course of investigation earlier a case was made out by the police that she was being harassed and tortured in connection with demand of dowry of motorcycle, cooler, fridge, bet and Rs.2,00,000/- cash and on account of persistent harassment and cruelty by in-laws, she committed suicide but after receipt of FSL and diatom reports, it revealed that infact she was murdered after Anand Arya vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 10 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/157340272/\n1 committing rape and allegations are against the present applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1789,
      "end": 2360,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Anand Arya vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2174,
          "end": 2215
        },
        {
          "text": "10 January, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2219,
          "end": 2235
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2676890790462494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "3 . Learned counsel for the applicants has submitted that applicants are in detention since 26.09.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2361,
      "end": 2464,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.09.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2453,
          "end": 2463
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2865489423274994
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "They have not committed any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2465,
      "end": 2501,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4124669134616852
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "They are innocent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2502,
      "end": 2520,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3700414299964905
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "They have been falsely implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2521,
      "end": 2555,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37525320053100586
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "There is no legal and admissible evidence to connect the applicants with commission of offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2556,
      "end": 2651,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4529370665550232
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Trial of the case will take considerable time.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2652,
      "end": 2698,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27361318469047546
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Therefore, it is prayed that applicants may be released on bail, pending the trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2699,
      "end": 2782,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2527194917201996
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "4 . On the other hand, learned counsel for the State has opposed the prayer for grant of bail to the applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2784,
      "end": 2896,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1547824591398239
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "5 . Having taken into consideration all the facts and circumstances of the case including the gravity of offence and availability of material on record but without expressing anything on the merits of the case, I am of the view that it is not a fit case for grant of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2897,
      "end": 3170,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36748582124710083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Consequently, this bail application under Section 483 of BNSS, 2023/Section 439 of CrPC, 1973 for grant of bail filed on behalf of applicants, stands dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3171,
      "end": 3331,
